# Environment template for Edenn.
#
# Every value here is blank on purpose. Nothing in this file is real and nothing
# in it ever was: this repository is a reference snapshot and carries no
# configuration that points at a running system. Copy to a local .env and fill
# in your own values; never commit a filled-in copy.
#
# The upstream provider names behind PROVIDER_A..PROVIDER_E and MODEL_GATEWAY
# are deliberately not written down here. See REDACTIONS.md.

